    "description": "<p>The Immaculate drives the fury of a thunderclap into a single strike, the impact releasing a burst of concussive force that rattles teeth and stuns the senses. On a successful hit supplemented by this Charm, the attack deals one additional die of damage. More importantly, the thunderous crack of the blow imposes a -1 internal penalty on the target's next action as they struggle to recover from the disorienting noise and concussive force. Multiple activations of this Charm against the same target in the same scene do not stack their penalties. This Charm is part of the Air Dragon Style.</p>",
